{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Embark on a thrilling odyssey through war-torn skies. In a post-apocalyptic realm where the boundary between technology and the supernatural has disintegrated. Take flight as the fearless pilot GHOST, accompanied by the enigmatic spirit known only as &quot;The Phoenix,&quot; as you are thrust into a relentless battle against possessed war machines and otherworldly monstrosities. Beautifully executed pixel art immerses you in this exhilarating, fast-paced top-down shoot 'em up! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Key Features</strong></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Upgrade Your Arsenal</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Salvage unique loot from fallen foes or gather blueprints from the chaos of battle and exchange them for the keys to a formidable array of new weapons. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2195710/extras/UpgradeArsenal.gif?t=1745085530\" /></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">The Night is Dark and Full of Terrors</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Will you dare to face the dangers of the night for the allure of greater rewards, or will you strategically navigate the daylight hours, ensuring a safer but potentially less lucrative journey?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2195710/extras/DayNight.gif?t=1745085530\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Unique Upgrades and Abilities</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Collect souls from fallen enemies and unlock permanent upgrades.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2195710/extras/PhxUpgradeCycle.gif?t=1745085530\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Relics of the Past</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Collect relics of the past from Elite enemy encounters and unlock unique abilities or passive upgrades to modify each journey.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2195710/extras/RelicOverview.gif?t=1745085530\" /></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2195710?t=1745085530","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2195710/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1745085530","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2195710/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1745085530","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2195710/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1745085530","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"demos":[{"appid":2819090,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Embark on a thrilling odyssey through war-torn skies. In a post-apocalyptic realm where the boundary between technology and the supernatural has disintegrated. Take flight as the fearless pilot GHOST, accompanied by the enigmatic spirit known only as &quot;The Phoenix,&quot; as you are thrust into a relentless battle against possessed war machines and otherworldly monstrosities. Beautifully executed pixel art immerses you in this exhilarating, fast-paced top-down shoot 'em up! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Key Features</strong></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Upgrade Your Arsenal</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Salvage unique loot from fallen foes or gather blueprints from the chaos of battle and exchange them for the keys to a formidable array of new weapons. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2195710/extras/UpgradeArsenal.gif?t=1745085530\" /></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">The Night is Dark and Full of Terrors</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Will you d